# OddHobb Tiny Worlds — give your AI a physical home

This might be one of the strongest OddHobb products yet. The miniature room is already a proven gift category, and the addition of personalised interiors, physical characters and persistent digital worlds creates a much more distinctive product.

The especially interesting version is:

Build a real miniature room → scan its QR code → enter its digital twin → meet the AI character that lives there.

You could sell the same underlying room as a conventional DIY kit, a personalised dollhouse, or an AI companion habitat.

Existing Rolife Super Creator miniature rooms. Notice the modular rooms that can be stacked into larger houses.

